语音目录的 voices.txt 里写着 文字 -> 音频文件；要朗读的文字能在表里找到时直接播放该文件，不访问 TTS 服务。表随改随生效#voices.txt in the voice folder maps 'text -> audio file'. When the text to speak is listed, that file is played directly without calling the TTS service. Edits take effect immediately:|
